# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (public). When unset, the bot-check widget is
# not rendered and no token is sent — matches the backend, which skips
# verification unless TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY is set. Get this from the Turnstile
# dashboard; it must pair with the backend's TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
